A stage monitor rental search usually collides with two other things: PA speaker listings that never mention on stage monitoring at all, and a handful of pages that quietly claim their wedges are self powered when they are not. Neither answers the actual question a band, a house of worship, or a conference organizer with live speakers has: what wedge is available, what powers it, and whether it comes with the rest of a booking or has to be arranged separately.

Malaga Event Gear stocks real HK Audio passive stage floor monitors, paired with our own amplifier channels, honestly described below rather than rounded up to sound more impressive than they are.

[Contact us](/contact/) with your stage plot or performer count for a quote.

