## Indoor and Outdoor Use

Most of the stage setups we deliver, indoors in a hotel ballroom or conference hall, or outdoors on a villa terrace or open air stage, work with the same passive wedge and amp rack pairing described above. We do not publish a generic weatherproofing claim, because the honest answer depends on your specific stage and venue. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue details, indoor or outdoor, and we will confirm the right setup for it.

## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as early as you can once your stage plot and performer count are confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, and stage monitor rental in particular needs enough lead time for us to confirm wedge count and the right amplifier pairing against our own limited stock of 8 units, rather than finding out on delivery day that the count does not work.

